# Google Maps Platform API Key (Vue / Vite client-side environment variable)
# Copy this file to .env.local and replace with your own key.
#
# Quickstart (Free Maps Demo Key - zero billing setup required for prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate / reveal your demo API key and paste it below.
# Note: Demo keys have a daily quota reset and are NOT for production use.
#
# For production, create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console with:
# - Maps JavaScript API (including Photorealistic 3D Maps)
# - Places API (New)
# - Elevation API
# Restrict the key by HTTP referrer before deploying.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
